			<div class="content" id="post-content-4844995">
									

<p>Was asked to take a look at this.</p>
<p>Can you explain the connection between the radio announcer and the horde idea? Like, I'm not sure what the take-away is here — 1930s radio announcers are getting out of control?</p>
<p>This seems like a very character-centric story but I don't feel like I have a handle on who the announcer character is. Is he aware of or responsible for the horde thing? What's going on?</p>
<p>In addition I recommend you use tropes like brainwashing and compulsion effects carefully, they tend to be easily understandable by your audience since they've seen them a dozen times, and thereof lose their novelty quickly.</p>

